{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-16_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-16","title":"爱国者之死","storyCode":"7-18","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"a7c82bd81b6158dedbd4e752f76f38dedfe78b5cb6ce27f2712c96ccc82a5a45","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，撑住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击干员，继续轰炸他的躯干部分，他的铠甲已经严重破损。术师，牵制住其他游击队战士，别让他们有机会插手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（哀鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"后撤，Mon3tr，近身缠斗没有优势！你已经无法阻止他前进了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"剑要脱手了！他......我连直接去抓他，都控制不了他，他感受起来，就像是山崩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"把能量聚集成束......收束。再收束，收束成线，照准他的心脏部位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尖啸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"照射。现在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这竟然也不足以破坏他的身体机能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怎么会这么胶着......！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“每一次战斗都是死斗，每次战斗都豁出性命，因为生命会回归血脉，生命将在他人体内永生......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫干员，不要怠慢......撤退。他的身躯也会释放“食人”仪式，他自身就是一个巨大的巫术装置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替，许多萨卡兹，并不希望你这样的温迪戈无谓地牺牲掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我怎么会，牺牲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还能动。我还能，杀死你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身体，还能听从，我的指挥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没体会尽，痛苦......不甘与遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就够了？这难道，就够了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替先生......停下吧，请你......停下吧！更多的战斗只是折磨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战士就是，要背负，所有死者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我背着，他们的痛，他们的恨，他们的沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，我，驻足......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们就是白死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"折磨？你们应该，感到折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，无法战胜我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"亲爱的......别难过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不会续弦？别这样，亲爱的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但您是不会认同我的这些絮叨的。您真是像石头一样顽固，我又有哪一次真说服过您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您还会继续打仗，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"答应我，博卓卡斯替，答应我。别死在战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望您不要再受折磨。您想一想，我离去后，这里依然有我们的家人陪伴着您，你看，小格尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他的睡脸，这是多么可爱的脸蛋啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他那两只还没长得很坚硬的，红彤彤的小角......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是生命。是我生命的延续。孩子，是大地上所有人生命的延续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道您不会吃掉我。您非常讨厌温迪戈的传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我多想永远在您的生命里流淌啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，生命......本来就不朽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您憔悴了。过度的伤感会摧毁您的，我们的孩子日后还需要您去照料，在这里徘徊，会毁了您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不，博卓卡斯替。您不是一个冷血的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您对我的爱是真切的。即使是我这样只善于厌恶他人的女人，也对您倾注了同等的感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您很惊讶......请不要惊讶。我是爱您的，就像您如此宽大又如此温热地爱着我一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替，我的挚爱......您未来的家人，都是我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就是这样爱您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海伦。我不配得到你的爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没能守住你。我也没能，守住誓言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的家人，我全都，没能保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爱......我配不上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被信赖的人，背弃了诺言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"背弃诺言的人，依然活着。即使如此，诺言，依然还在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为诺言里，还有悔恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅是，已死的人。菲林，你的悔恨，在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要，背着，走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城里的人。乌萨斯的感染者。大地上，失去父母的人。大地上，父母做下错事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都会被人背负。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲，我请求你！不要，不要再站在帝国那一边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"命令？帝国的命令就是笑话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，抱歉，父亲......我不是在嘲讽你。不。我不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但帝国的法令，就是为我们所有人设下的残忍骗局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友叶克多，只因为被查出是矿石病人，就被笞杖活活打死在桥上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是也很喜欢他的诗吗？你不是也曾在夜晚大声朗诵，喜极而泣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他死了！他走上了昏暗的死路，永远离我们而去，再也不会回头了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作为诗人，除了文学，任何人也没有让他死去的资格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帝国的所谓感染者法令，只是一个闯入我们心中的恶徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那种死亡，看啊，感染者的死亡，也只是让夺走生命的人和失去生命的人都舍弃了尊严！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帝国的士兵们，难道是为了这种没有尊严的事领受皇帝的恩惠吗？太荒谬了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出身卡兹戴尔的你，和你一起长大的那些感染的萨卡兹......你也一定能理解我们乌萨斯的感染者的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么那样无所谓？你的心肠难道也是是铁铸的吗？还是说，因为你作为萨卡兹却没有被感染，所以你心里连一点同情都没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们萨卡兹......有谁会比萨卡兹更容易感染矿石病呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，当我们中有人感染矿石病的时候，你就会知道这种罪名是多么可笑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许到那时候，你才能离开你现在行走的血路，走上宽敞仁慈的大道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲......罢了，罢了！你可是博卓卡斯替！矿石病不会纠缠你这样强悍的军人，那就只能让它爬上我的身躯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当它盘踞在我的遗体上对你哈哈大笑的时候，你才会意识到自己的错误！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要让自己后悔，父亲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......格罗瓦兹尔，你是无辜的。你是无罪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染的，是我。隐瞒的，也是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲终归，有眼却盲，父亲没能，走上正途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......很后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真的，很后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我儿......父亲杀了你，父亲还让你，白白死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲......不配，做你的父亲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我停止战斗，就是背叛他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"越来越多......我看到......越来越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"爱国者先生......这么多，这么多的悔恨......从来都不说，你从来都不向任何人去倾诉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的悔恨，只有我能承受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，别靠近他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会想，为什么，殿下那样的人，也会遭遇不测？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会回答我。殿下的死，至今都，扑朔迷离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道。她不曾逃避。她从头至尾，都只微笑面对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我停止战斗，所有的反抗，都失去意义。我停止战斗，就是逃避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能停止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有血缘关系吧？一直叫你爸爸，还挺奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你脸色有点不太好啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"才没有！才不是因为......因为兄弟姐妹们害怕我呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，你有什么办法吗，让他们不因为你躲我躲得远远的办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有的话，叫你爸爸也可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？要挟？那个词儿是什么意思啊，你还没有教我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你说哥哥学什么东西都很快，不像我这样只能按部就班地来......那哥哥现在在哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，唉？！为什么突然抱住我！你会冻伤的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你在哭吗？好像有水掉在我肩上了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有？所有人都说爸爸无血无泪，那就是说爸爸不会哭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是爸爸明明会哭啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我前面只是瞎说的，瞎说的！爸爸哭，是因为冻得太疼了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，爸爸！我不会再像刚才那么说了，而且，我长大以后，长大以后......长大以后一定给你做一种让你不会被冻坏的药！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样你就不会再被疼哭了，对吗？我一定会快快长大的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"家人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是说，我的兄弟姐妹们，还有你我，都是家人？不在这里的哥哥也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这样的话，爸爸，就是大家的爸爸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也一定会学习爸爸，帮外婆报仇，杀掉那些欺负我们的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不准这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么！明明爸爸每天都在杀那些坏人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什么叫不想我成为爸爸这样的人？爸爸难道不是好人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么爸爸也是坏人？！我不懂，你说明白！爸爸怎么会是坏人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌爸爸。讨厌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不学爸爸，就能到城里去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......你说，我们真的能到城里去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说的什么手指糖.....真的好吃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果要不当爸爸这样的人才能吃到的话......唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，不管怎么样，好人和坏人，我都可以当的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要永远和爸爸，还有兄弟姐妹们一起......一直在一起就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸是我的家人。我知道的，爸爸是我最好的家人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女儿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，第二是......第三是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叶莲娜......叶莲娜......我的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的女儿......父亲，什么，都没能，为你做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我什么，都没做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我亏欠你，太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"太多了，太多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯女孩。你是，罗德岛的领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟，哪里出众？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有个成员，向我描述过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的战士，十分优秀。但仅仅优秀，还是会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有哪里，能让我，看到价值？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想阻止，核心城，却无法，战胜我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"别想碰阿米娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"一把，两把，三把......第四把！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盾，碎了。\n戟，断了。\n巨大的怪物，没有停下脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然能，钉穿铠甲。这副铠甲，终于到了极限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......你挣脱不了的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，你很强大。你对我是威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，爱国者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我离你，只有十步。不用再等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经到极限了，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你毕竟不像霜星小姐，你并不是个术师......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那这一下就已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这个法术里有......我看到的所有事情。我在你身上看到的所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......已经够了，爱国者先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"已经够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......这是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一击，很精准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已，不再能挪步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......所有损伤，堆砌到了极限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我本打算，击溃你们，之后让游击队，假借你们名义，杀死塔露拉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（现在，已经不必。你们胜了，你们名正言顺。去杀死，塔露拉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（爱国者......先生？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我怎么能允许，感染者，被奴役他人者，利用？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我的命，你们拿去用。这是胜者的，战利品。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，胜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勋爵，这个，请拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下切城的秘钥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们，去舰桥区......你们要带上它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"爱国者先生，你......只为了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确打算，杀了你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，你们战胜了我。你们应得。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"为什么要做到这一步？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我不信你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只相信，战争的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我女儿，只是天真，她会网开一面，也会假设结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会。我只等到结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，最好的结果......就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的士兵，因为惊讶，没能发挥全力。他们活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我一人......为之而死。我死得其所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，生物处理室13号舱，给我图表！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"舱室的内部温度急剧升高！能量在外放！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，它的形态在转化！经过十四小时的处理，为什么还会进入到这一阶段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS，刚才是谁使用了这个舱位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}？我们在龙门攻防战里有干员伤亡吗？这处理的是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你慢点说，你说Dr.{@nickname}在舱位里安置了谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勋爵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我在听，博卓卡斯替。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们温迪戈，自我流放，失去一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们身负，萨卡兹的传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先祖，塑造我，培育我，注视我。所以，请替我见证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道自己够不够格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为你是，最好人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“......我在此担当一位萨卡兹的见证者。博卓卡斯替，卡兹戴尔的温迪戈，一生从未背叛过血肉，也从未愧对亲族。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“他将把一生留在光芒下的身体里......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“......而他的精魂，则将回到温迪戈温热的血脉中去。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这是个诅咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我，并不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我感到......我感到，我清晰的视野，开始模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，勋爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你讨厌这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我，已经老了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，原来是这样。哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉真的背叛我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我们会坐以待毙吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不是对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"有来世的话，向我报仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为知道会死，所以就要放弃了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样被你们无故杀了而——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"别杀他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族人，我会给你们不知疼痛的身躯。让他们走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我们比你的牧群强大得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以把我的生命拿出来和你们分享，你们能真正地永远战斗，不知疲倦地战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们要出去，也必须由我的同伴看着。现在还不能违背塔露拉的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，弩手。出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（为什么他会救我们......？难道塔露拉还有什么阴谋？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你为什么特意要到这里来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为我想进去这里。我想知道这里有什么样的秘密。我想知道罗德岛究竟为什么会从这里带走一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我从录像里看到那个人从这里出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......？为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，想听歌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，浮士德队长他说，他说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，是的。我已经不会唱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但我可以试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是首摇篮曲吧？不记得是有谁教过我这首曲子......我不记得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有人在我的梦里，一直地哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉睡吧，沉睡吧♪\n刺猬玩偶与小熊们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的，感染者，又要走去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晦暗的夜晚，还会遮蔽......多少明星？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......大尉，大尉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"大尉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗下去。活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的路，只有你们......自己去走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了，才有路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必定要死。只是不知道，是否该是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的死，究竟能，改变什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许这个问题，你们，才能回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉进静静的黑色......\n哥哥，姐姐，妹妹，弟弟，梦乡啊梦乡，盖住了他们的身体......♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“小姐”？怎么在这哭唧唧的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"谁哭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。不过，这可是近卫局大楼门口啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"让别人看到你哭，真就好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"反正......反正也没有别人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这样好了，我坐你前面的台阶上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我个子大，挡住你，就没人看得见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什么啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。就是因为没做好，才觉得不太爽吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Missy，我们两个算是都失败了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不管......不管她去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是。我知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不要打我。是不是我无论怎么回答都会被打啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......这一生......得以结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海伦......格罗瓦兹尔......叶莲娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我终于......能够回家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......我，不要幻觉，不要慰藉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁引我看到......幻觉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......为什么......为什么爱国者先生会......挣脱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是你。卡特斯。是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，你就是......继承者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯，说谎。殿下她......有继承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我死在......魔王的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......怎么会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终归，没逃过命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅？！你不可以......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对，对不起！但，但凯尔希医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，过去，萨卡兹的君主，将愿景与抚慰，作为赏赐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的功臣，能见宏伟高墙，或是已逝挚爱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无数战士，为此幻境，奋战不息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，我只是......爱国者先生，我不想......不想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你生命的最后......明明不该这样凄惨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到......我看到了，我看到你两百多年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不断地战斗......不断地战斗，失去，失去......失去了一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想......我不想这就是你的......结局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的，结局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想让你有个......更好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的结局，怎么能由，别人给予！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻觉？不！那不是结局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果悲惨，那就悲惨。如果愚蠢，那就愚蠢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是，我的结局。是我......应得结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我活过，反抗过，失败过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经，够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，为什么......为什么就够了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人该这样失去一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还是个，小孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是什么孩子！我已经战斗了无数次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好结局，从不理所应当。孩子，才相信童谣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我的女儿，都只是，相信童谣的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说霜星那些，太重了......太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意，她的观点。她只是......年幼的孩子。只是，年幼的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病，奴隶主，这片大地......竟容不得，一个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉送她，去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么我们不能一同去对抗塔露拉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能，带给我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，曾经带给我的，你甚至还，做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后，你又会，变成什么样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是命运。我尝到，太多滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我决不向命运，低头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使命运，每次都赐我，相同结局......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也宁可，每日与它缠斗，直至太阳，再次升起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......你也许能改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与命运抗争，无数年......终归，还是，没能胜过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你......你也许，不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有资格，继承那位殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有能力，活着离开这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有胆识，踏进无边荒原？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我一个人是不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不是一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切......都属于你们。只有你们......去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......整合运动的，暴君，命运......你们自己......去推翻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等等。\n不对。\n凯尔希抬眼望向阴沉的天空。\n我在哪里见过这些？\n难道说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......阿米娅......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的预言来自种群记忆的全面融合。源石多生区域发生的源石能量爆发......核心城恰好遭遇了天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"祭坛......阿米娅......温迪戈......魔王？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，如果这能直接影响到......不可能！古老的温迪戈最后的血脉直接贯通了萨卡兹的整支族群吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这个预言......这个预言？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雪？“食人”的博卓卡斯替和所有祭坛发生了共鸣？！还有我刚才施加的......温迪戈的回魂......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各位干员！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"无论他说什么......无论博卓卡斯替说了些什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"【一个字也不要信！】"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"温迪戈忽然开口，沙哑的声音似乎传遍了整个中央区。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我见诸城，满目疮痍。\n我见源石，遍布大地。\n我见你，头顶黑冠，将千万生灵，熬成回忆。\n我见魔王，将所有种群，尽数奴役。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什......么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"爱国者！预言是不可信的！那只是源石技艺的生理性残留！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......但我知晓......所有预言......全都实现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也正死在，魔王之手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......勋爵。不。勋爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替！！你不是用一生反抗了命运吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年幼的，魔王......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你，你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"会是大地上最可怖的灾难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她必须死！\n否则，这片大地就会死去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能让你，活在世上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱国者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可恨我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铠甲的碰撞声传入你的耳中。\n已经浑身碎裂的怪物，突然向阿米娅伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_13"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_14"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_15"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩没有闪躲。死亡的阴影袭上了她被硝烟染黑的面庞，她没有挪步，没有惊叫，仅仅是直视着爱国者的双眼。\n如同想要望进他的灵魂。\n于此同时，沉重的黑色利剑与闪烁着不详光芒的能量束，飞速地刺入了巨人那具不死之躯，却也依然没能撼动他分毫。\n就在爱国者即将捏碎黑衣女孩的头颅时......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_16"},{"type":"narration","text":"温迪戈的动作，戛然而止。\n似乎有什么从他头盔中悄然滴落。\n......\n一分钟过去了。\n在这漫长的一分钟里，除了移动城市的隆隆声外，你什么也听不见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_17"},{"type":"narration","text":"你意识到，面前的怪物已经死了。\n一步也不曾后退。一秒也没有放弃。即使如此，死亡还是停下了他一生的行军。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
